abstract: >-
  Reference library for EIO (Evaluation Intelligence Ontology) and the Portable Evaluation Record (PER 2.1) for AI-agent evaluation.
  A model-graded verdict can support but never prove a claim, and a computed per-predicate witness rule
  decides which typed evidence can prove agent behaviour. Records are canonical and content-addressed, so
  a recipient with the exact evaluation bundle and matching library release can re-derive a record and check its digest.
